{"type":"message","id":"7120914c","parentId":"73d8e7ac","timestamp":"2026-02-23T21:40:23.900Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_PKP9UmdnYmH6QkBKZxjbVBFI|fc_083513c1b394bce001699cc9409fbc8191b681a56d1915b9f7","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"===== LAST RUN eb4407c8-7e9a-4d66-b956-2695d5aee260 =====\n{\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"ts\": 1771882583717,\n      \"jobId\": \"eb4407c8-7e9a-4d66-b956-2695d5aee260\",\n      \"action\": \"finished\",\n      \"status\": \"ok\",\n      \"summary\": \"아침 브리핑 - 2월 24일 (화요일)\\n\\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\\n\\n🌤️  서울 날씨\\n현재: 🌧 비 +1°C\\n비가 오고 있고 매우 춥습니다. 외출 시 우산과 따뜻한 옷 필수.\\n\\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\\n\\n⚙️  시스템 상태\\n• OpenClaw Gateway: ✅ 실행 중 (PID: 2496422)\\n• 버전: v2026.2.22-2\\n• 디스크 사용량: 3% (23G / 933G 여유)\\n• 토큰: 95% 남음 (1시간 24분)\\n• 서비스: systemd active\\n\\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\\n\\n⚠️  주의사항\\n\\n[Telegram 크론 알림 전송 실패]\\n• 보안 감사, 업데이트 체크, 메모리 유지보수, 아침 브리핑, Notion 브리핑 작업에서 \\\"cron announce delivery failed\\\" 에러 발생\\n• 일반 메시지는 정상 전송되지만, 크론 작업 알림만 전송 실패\\n• GitHub 백업 작업만 정상 작동 중\\n\\n원인: Gateway-Telegram 연결 또는 API 전송 문제로 추정\\n\\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\\n\\n조치 필요\\nGateway 서비스 재시작으로 Telegram 연결 재설정 권장\",\n      \"runAtMs\": 1771882528302,\n      \"durationMs\": 55414,\n      \"nextRunAtMs\": 1771884000000,\n      \"model\": \"glm-4.7\",\n      \"provider\": \"zai\",\n      \"usage\": {\n        \"input_tokens\": 9576,\n        \"output_tokens\": 2586,\n        \"total_tokens\": 19698\n      },\n      \"delivered\": true,\n      \"deliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n      \"sessionId\": \"b183be02-06ca-411e-8951-1b80f9a5f38f\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:cron:eb4407c8-7e9a-4d66-b956-2695d5aee260:run:b183be02-06ca-411e-8951-1b80f9a5f38f\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n===== LAST RUN 9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89 =====\n{\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"ts\": 1771882657161,\n      \"jobId\": \"9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89\",\n      \"action\": \"finished\",\n      \"status\": \"ok\",\n      \"summary\": \"🌌 **Morning Sam! Here's your Notion daily briefing for Feb 22nd 07:00 ~ Feb 23rd 07:00:**\\n\\n---\\n\\n**⚡ ACTION REQUIRED**\\n\\n1. **SAP EP Server Incident Update Request** (from Jay.Choi)\\n   - Sam.Yeo reported the SAP EP server boot failure, MS case opened, and VM backup recovery in progress\\n   - Jay.Choi is asking for a status update on the situation\\n\\n---\\n\\n**✅ APPROVALS NEEDED**\\n\\n2. **Teams Meeting Numeric Passcodes - Review & Approve** (from Sabareeswaran.R)\\n   - Per Sam's request, Korean UAT test accounts have been added to the Teams meeting simplified numeric passcode pilot group\\n   - This is a global change for better user experience\\n   - Other regions are requesting this urgently — please review and approve as soon as possible\\n\\n---\\n\\n**📋 FYI**\\n\\n3. **SAP EP Incident Resolved** (from Sam.Yeo)\\n   - SAP EP server experienced downtime\\n   - Server recovery completed at 08:49 AM\\n   - EP service check finished at 11:25 AM — service is back to normal\\n   - Jay.Choi responded: \\\"Good\\\"\\n\\n4. **Azure Backup Daily Report** (from Shinwoo.Kim)\\n   - Daily and weekly backup policy compliance report\\n   - Includes inline data on backup success/failure from last week\\n   - One daily backup failure recorded on February 21, 2026\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Summary:** 1 action item, 1 approval pending, 3 FYI items. The SAP incident is resolved, but you have an update pending. The Teams passcode implementation is waiting for your green light.\",\n      \"runAtMs\": 1771882584593,\n      \"durationMs\": 72567,\n      \"nextRunAtMs\": 1771887600000,\n      \"model\": \"glm-4.7\",\n      \"provider\": \"zai\",\n      \"usage\": {\n        \"input_tokens\": 870,\n        \"output_tokens\": 1087,\n        \"total_tokens\": 10259\n      },\n      \"delivered\": true,\n      \"deliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n      \"sessionId\": \"d026d754-356d-4373-a1c3-8a74f4152d7e\",\n      \"sessio